  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ng’ei gin maeni, nia Naboth ma Jayezreli bedo ku podho mir ulok, ma ni i Yezrel, ceng’ni odker pa Ahab m’ubimo mi Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ahab uyero ni Naboth, ewacu kumae, Mi podho mir ulok peri ira, kara abed kude ni podho mi dek, kum eni ceng’ni ba ot para; man abiwile iri ku podho mir ulok ma sage: kadi, tek ebedo ber iri, abimio iri wel pinje i sente. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Naboth uwacu ni Ahab kumae, Yehova cera, kud ami aba pa kwara iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Ahab ubino i ot pare ku cwinye m’udieng’ ma lembe ton i ie de kum lembe ma Naboth ma Jayezreli yero ire; kum ewacu kumae, Abimio iri aba pa kwara ngo. E evuto piny wi kavuto pare, man eloko wang’e yo woko, man ekwero camu kwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yezebel ma dhaku pare bino i bang’e man ewacu ire kumae, Cwinyi bedo ku can ma kumeno nedi, ketho icamu kwen moko ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu ire kumae, Kum ayero ni Naboth ma Jayezreli, man awacu ire kumae, Mi podho mir ulok peri ira mi sente; kadi, tek ebedo ber iri, abimio iri podho mir ulok mange pire: man eloko lembe kumae, Abimio podho mir ulok para iri ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yezebel ma dhaku pare wacu ire kumae, Kawono ibimo ker mir Israeli? ai malu, man icam kwen, man wek anyong’a neg adundeni: abimio iri podho mir ulok pa Naboth ma Jayezreli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno egoro waraga ku nying Ahab, emwonogi de kud ayi pare, man eoro waragane ba judongo man ba weg yung ma ni i adhura pare, man m’ubedo karacelo ku Naboth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E egoro i waragane, ewacu kumae, Wuyer pi wekocam, man wuketh Naboth malu i kind dhanu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wuketh dhanu ario, ma dhanu ma rac, i wang’e, e wek ginyuth lembe i kume, giwac kumae, Ikwong’o Mungu kud ubimo de. Man wulund wutere woko, e wucanye ku kidi kara etho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanu mir adhura pare, en e judongo ku weg yung m’ubedo i adhura pare, gitimo calu Yezebel uoro i bang’e, calu ebedo agora i waraga m’eoro i bang’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giyero pi wekocam, man giketho Naboth malu i kind dhanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanu arione, ma dhanu ma rac, gimondo man gibedo i wang’e: e dhanu ma racne ginyutho lembe i kume, en e i kum Naboth i vut dhanu, giwacu kumae, Naboth ukwong’o Mungu kud ubimo. Gilund gitere woko kud i adhura, e gicanye ku kidi m’etho ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilund gioro kwenda ba Yezebel, giwacu kumae, Jucanyu Naboth ku kidi, man etho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E etimbre, kinde ma Yezebel uwinjo nia jucanyu Naboth ku kidi, man etho, nia Yezebel uwacu ni Ahab kumae, Ai malu, mak podho mir ulok pa Naboth ma Jayezreli, m’ekwero mio iri mi sente; kum Naboth ubedo kwo ngo, ento etho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma Ahab uwinjo nia Naboth utho, nia Ahab uai malu kara elor piny ba podho mir ulok pa Naboth ma Jayezreli, kara emake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E lembe pa Yehova bino bang’ Elia ma Jaticbi, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai, lor piny kara wuromb kud Ahab m’ubimo mir Israel, m’ubedo i Samaria: nen, eni i podho mir ulok pa Naboth, ka m’eloro i ie piny kara emake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ibiyero ire, ibiwacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Inego, man imaku bende? Man ibiyero ire, ibiwacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, I ka ma gwogi nang’u ie rimb Naboth, e gwogi binang’u rimbi keca, en e peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Ahab uwacu ni Elia kumae, Inwang’a, E jadegi para? Man eloko lembe kumae, Anweng’i, kum ing’ieuri giri kara itim gin ma rac i wang’ Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, abikelo lembe ma rac i wii, man abiyweyi woko pet man abikabu nyithindho ma co ceke kubang’gi kubang’gi ku bang’ Ahab, man ng’atu ma juciko bang’e ku ng’atu ma jugonyo i kind Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abidwoko ot peri calu ot pa Yeroboam ma wod Nebat, man calu ot pa Baca ma wod Ahija kum dubo m’inyayu kudo ng’ecwiny i ia, man kum iketho Israel udubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ub 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero pi Yezebel bende, ewacu kumae, Gwogi bicamu Yezebel i ng’et ot ma tek mi Yezrel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanu pa Ahab m’utho i adhura gwogi bicamu; man ng’atu m’utho i podho winyo ma kor polo bicamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ento ng’atu moko mbe ma calu Ahab, m’ung’ieure gire kara etim gin ma rac i wang’ Yehova, ma Yezebel ma dhaku pare thubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimo ginmajudagu dit kum lubo mungu m’araga, calku gin ceke ma Juamori timo, ma Yehova bayu woko i wang’ nyithindho mir Israel.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma Ahab uwinjo lembe maeni, nia eyeco kendi pare, man eke tho gonia i kume, e ekwiro cam, man evuto i gonia, man ewotho yo yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E lembe pa Yehova bino bang’ Elia ma Jaticbi, uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
